# Butler Routes - Teldrassil completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.7.0).
# Every Teldrassil quest in the local census (95 quests, docs/teldrassil-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# No race header: the data leaves open quests to all Alliance and starts
# Human, Dwarf and Gnome Priest lines with Laurna in Dolanaar, so per-line
# `only` gates carry every restriction instead. Chain order is strictly
# turn-in-before-accept (external pres become notes plus listed structural
# warnings, or when onquest mini-steps where completes would wedge the sim);
# item-started quests never wedge (note at the source, no blocking line);
# elites and the Mo'grosh-style group spots get notes, not silent solos.
# Coordinates on Teldrassil use the era frame; Darkshore, Ironforge and
# Stormwind stops use the frames their data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/teldrassil
title Teldrassil - Completionist
levels 1-10
zone Teldrassil
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords teldrassil, completionist, shadowglen, dolanaar, denalan
coords live
version 1

step Shadowglen - spawn

  zone map 1438

  tip Shadowglen, the Night Elf start. Ilthalaine (58.7, 44.3) sets the Balance of Nature; Melithar (59.9, 42.5) points you at the dryad Tarindrella; Shanda (59.2, 40.4) and the class trainers stand around the hollow.
  accept 456 -- The Balance of Nature - Conservator Ilthalaine; seven Young Nightsabers and four Young Thistle Boars
  complete 456 @56.6,44.5 era -- seven Young Nightsabers
  complete 456 @55.1,43.4 era -- four Young Thistle Boars
  turnin 456 -- The Balance of Nature - back to Conservator Ilthalaine
  accept 457 -- The Balance of Nature - Conservator Ilthalaine; seven Mangy Nightsabers and seven Thistle Boars
  complete 457 @58.9,35.9 era -- seven Mangy Nightsabers
  complete 457 @55.3,37.1 era -- seven Thistle Boars
  turnin 457 -- The Balance of Nature - back to Conservator Ilthalaine
  accept 3116 only NightElf,Warrior -- Simple Sigil - Conservator Ilthalaine; carry it to Alyissia
  accept 3117 only NightElf,Hunter -- Etched Sigil - Conservator Ilthalaine; carry it to Ayanna Everstride
  accept 3118 only NightElf,Rogue -- Encrypted Sigil - Conservator Ilthalaine; carry it to Frahun Shadewhisper
  accept 3119 only NightElf,Priest -- Hallowed Sigil - Conservator Ilthalaine; carry it to Shanda
  accept 3120 only NightElf,Druid -- Verdant Sigil - Conservator Ilthalaine; carry it to Mardant Strongoak
  turnin 3116 only NightElf,Warrior -- Simple Sigil - the sigil to Alyissia
  turnin 3117 only NightElf,Hunter -- Etched Sigil - the sigil to Ayanna Everstride
  turnin 3118 only NightElf,Rogue -- Encrypted Sigil - the sigil to Frahun Shadewhisper
  turnin 3119 only NightElf,Priest -- Hallowed Sigil - the sigil to Shanda
  turnin 3120 only NightElf,Druid -- Verdant Sigil - the sigil to Mardant Strongoak
  accept 458 -- The Woodland Protector - Melithar Staghelm; seek out the dryad Tarindrella
  turnin 458 -- The Woodland Protector - Melithar's word to Tarindrella
  accept 459 -- The Woodland Protector - Tarindrella; eight Fel Moss
  complete 459 @55.7,46.0 era -- eight Fel Moss off the Grell and Grellkin
  turnin 459 -- The Woodland Protector - the moss to Tarindrella
  accept 97977 -- Nature's Call - Tarindrella; four Gnarlpine Totems
  complete 97977 @54.5,44.1 era -- four Gnarlpine Totems around the hollow
  turnin 97977 -- Nature's Call - the totems to Tarindrella
  accept 97979 -- The Goddess Provides - Shanda
  turnin 97979 -- The Goddess Provides - back to Shanda
  note Welcome! (5842) starts from Orenthil's Gift Voucher - same kind as Dun Morogh's check-bags voucher, so look in your bags before anything else.
  accept 5842 -- Welcome! - Orenthil Whisperwind's Gift Voucher
  turnin 5842 -- Welcome! - the voucher to Orenthil Whisperwind

step Shadowglen - the Webwood cave

  tip The cave mouth north of the hollow (venom sacs, eggs, mushrooms, the journal) and Iverron's camp beyond it. Ayanna's Hunter's Path starts here for later; Blackmoss the Fetid and Githyiss are rares - take their drops if you see them, never camp them.
  accept 916 -- Webwood Venom - Gilshalan Windwalker; ten Webwood Venom Sacs
  complete 916 @55.5,27.6 era -- ten Webwood Venom Sacs off the Webwood Spiders by the cave
  turnin 916 -- Webwood Venom - the sacs to Gilshalan Windwalker
  accept 917 -- Webwood Egg - Gilshalan Windwalker; the Webwood Egg
  complete 917 @56.7,26.5 era -- the Webwood Egg in the cave
  turnin 917 -- Webwood Egg - the egg to Gilshalan Windwalker
  accept 920 -- Tenaron's Summons - Gilshalan Windwalker; Tenaron wants you
  turnin 920 -- Tenaron's Summons - Gilshalan's word to Tenaron Stormgrip
  accept 921 -- Crown of the Earth - Tenaron Stormgrip; fill the Crystal Phial
  complete 921 @60.0,33.1 era -- the Crystal Phial at the Shadowglen Moonwell
  turnin 921 -- Crown of the Earth - the filled phial to Tenaron Stormgrip
  note The Moss-twined Heart (927) starts from the Heart Blackmoss the Fetid carries - rare spawn, north slopes (42-43, 27-37). Take it if it drops, hand it to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth; the route never waits on it.
  accept 927 -- The Moss-twined Heart - the Heart to Denalan
  note Fang of Githyiss (97236) starts from the Fang (Githyiss the Vile, in this cave at 56.7, 26.3). Take it if it drops, hand it to Gilshalan; the route never waits on it.
  accept 97236 -- Fang of Githyiss - the Fang to Gilshalan Windwalker
  turnin 97236 -- Fang of Githyiss - the Fang to Gilshalan Windwalker
  accept 4495 -- A Good Friend - Dirania Silvershine; find Iverron
  turnin 4495 -- A Good Friend - Dirania's word to Iverron
  accept 3519 -- A Friend in Need - Iverron; Dirania can help
  turnin 3519 -- A Friend in Need - Iverron's word to Dirania Silvershine
  accept 3521 -- Iverron's Antidote - Dirania Silvershine; mushrooms and ichor
  complete 3521 @54.5,41.7 era -- seven Hyacinth Mushrooms around the hollow
  complete 3521 @56.5,38.9 era -- four Moonpetal Lilies
  complete 3521 @55.5,27.6 era -- Webwood Ichor off the Webwood Spiders
  turnin 3521 -- Iverron's Antidote - the reagents to Dirania Silvershine
  accept 3522 -- Iverron's Antidote - Dirania Silvershine; carry the antidote back
  turnin 3522 -- Iverron's Antidote - the antidote to Iverron
  accept 928 -- Crown of the Earth - Tenaron Stormgrip; the Lost Journal
  note The Adventurer (96630) starts from the Lost Journal by the hollow (59.1, 39.6). Pick it up if you see it; Lyreena in Dolanaar takes the story.
  accept 96630 -- The Adventurer - the Lost Journal

step Dolanaar - the hub

  tip Dolanaar, the zone hub. Innkeeper Keldamyr (55.6, 59.8) binds your home; Zarrin (57.1, 61.3) cooks, Aldia (55.5, 57.2) keeps the store, Syral (56.1, 57.7) mixes, Byancie (55.3, 56.8) sews; Dazalar (56.7, 59.5) trains hunters, Laurna (55.6, 56.8) keeps the priests, Amara and Kyra (52.9, 57.2 and 56.2, 59.2) the warriors and rogues. Take every quest in town before you head out.
  turnin 928 -- Crown of the Earth - Tenaron's word to Corithras Moonrage
  accept 929 -- Crown of the Earth - Corithras Moonrage; fill the Jade Phial at Starbreeze
  turnin 96630 -- The Adventurer - the journal's story to Lyreena Duskblade
  accept 475 -- A Troubling Breeze - Athridas Bearmantle; seek out Gaerolas in Starbreeze Village
  accept 487 -- The Road to Darnassus - Moon Priestess Amara; Gnarlpine Ambushers south of the den
  accept 488 -- Zenn's Bidding - Zenn Foulhoof; fangs, feathers and silk
  note Seek Redemption! (489) starts here too but needs 488 first - take it when offered.
  accept 489 -- Seek Redemption! - Amara, Kyra and Syral; three Fel Cones
  accept 932 -- Twisted Hatred - Tallonkai Swiftroot; Melenas' Head
  complete 932 @51.2,50.8 era -- Lord Melenas' Head, just south of town
  turnin 932 -- Twisted Hatred - the head to Tallonkai Swiftroot
  accept 98403 -- Twisted Hatred - Tallonkai Swiftroot; the Befouled Webwood and Xethorr the Wicked (level-12 elite - bring help)
  accept 2438 -- The Emerald Dreamcatcher - Tallonkai Swiftroot; the Dreamcatcher from the dresser
  note Ferocitas the Dream Eater (2459) starts here too but needs the Dreamcatcher first - take it when offered.
  accept 2459 -- Ferocitas the Dream Eater - Tallonkai Swiftroot; the Mystic and the jewel, east
  accept 2159 -- Dolanaar Delivery - Porthannius; a delivery for Innkeeper Keldamyr
  accept 997 -- Denalan's Earth - Syral Bladeleaf; Denalan's Earth for Denalan at the lake
  accept 5622 only NightElf,Priest -- In Favor of Elune - Shanda; Laurna in Dolanaar wants you
  accept 98391 -- The Sisterhood of Elune - Laurna Morninglight; Sister Aquinne waits in Darnassus, late
  note The Relics of Wakening (483) starts here too but needs 476 (Gaerolas, Starbreeze) first - take it when offered.
  accept 483 -- The Relics of Wakening - Athridas Bearmantle; the four barrow-den relics
  accept 87288 -- Soft Saber Pelts - Aldia; six Soft Nightsaber Pelts
  complete 87288 @48.5,50.0 era -- six Soft Nightsaber Pelts off the Nightsabers, west
  turnin 87288 -- Soft Saber Pelts - the pelts to Aldia
  accept 99046 -- The Lost Runner - Sentinel Kyra Starsong; find Eralya at the Oracle Glade
  turnin 2159 -- Dolanaar Delivery - the delivery to Innkeeper Keldamyr

step Dolanaar - the metalsmith's errand
  when skill Alchemy 1

  note Elixirs for the Bladeleafs (1581) wants six Elixirs of Lion's Strength and two of Minor Defense; the data lists no Teldrassil source, so have them in your bags (auction house or an alchemist) before you turn in. Non-alchemists skip this step cleanly.
  accept 1581 -- Elixirs for the Bladeleafs - Syral Bladeleaf; the elixirs
  turnin 1581 -- Elixirs for the Bladeleafs - the elixirs to Syral Bladeleaf

step Dolanaar - the cook's errand
  when skill Cooking 1

  note Recipe of the Kaldorei (4161) wants seven Small Spider Legs; the data's spiders live in Elwynn, so have the legs in your bags (auction house or a trip east) before you turn in. Non-cooks skip this step cleanly.
  accept 4161 -- Recipe of the Kaldorei - Zarrin; seven Small Spider Legs
  turnin 4161 -- Recipe of the Kaldorei - the legs to Zarrin

step Dolanaar - campers by the fire
  note Lyreena's Camping lessons are all optional: The Great Outdoors first, then whichever 101 matches your profession. The three Darkshore trainers (Elisa, Jenna, Kurdram) get their turn-ins on the Auberdine trip, late; Astaia and Trianna take theirs on the Darnassus trip.
