step Dolanaar - the taming chain (Hunter, level 10)
  only Hunter

  tip Start back at Ayanna Everstride in Shadowglen (58.7, 40.5) if you have not taken the path yet, then Dazalar (56.7, 59.5) lends you the work: tame a Webwood Lurker, then a Nightsaber Stalker with Ayanna's blessing behind you, then a Strigid Screecher, and Jocaste in Darnassus takes the report, late.
  accept 6072 only NightElf,Hunter -- The Hunter's Path - Ayanna Everstride; Dazalar in Dolanaar teaches the taming Dazalar (56.7, 59.5), Dolanaar's hunter trainer, lends you the work: tame a Webwood Lurker, then a Nightsaber Stalker with Ayanna's blessing behind you, then a Strigid Screecher, and Jocaste in Darnassus takes the report, late.
  turnin 6072 only NightElf,Hunter -- The Hunter's Path - Ayanna's word to Dazalar
  accept 6063 -- Taming the Beast - Dazalar; tame a Webwood Lurker
  complete 6063 @45.9,46.7 era -- tame a Webwood Lurker, west (don't kill it)
  turnin 6063 -- Taming the Beast - back to Dazalar
  accept 6101 -- Taming the Beast - Dazalar; tame a Nightsaber Stalker
  complete 6101 @38.2,58.6 era -- tame a Nightsaber Stalker (Ayanna's blessing covers you)
  turnin 6101 -- Taming the Beast - back to Dazalar
  accept 6102 -- Taming the Beast - Dazalar; tame a Strigid Screecher
  complete 6102 @37.6,51.3 era -- tame a Strigid Screecher
  turnin 6102 -- Taming the Beast - back to Dazalar
  accept 6103 -- Training the Beast - Dazalar; carry it to Jocaste in Darnassus, late

step Starbreeze Village - relics and dreams

  tip East to Starbreeze: Gaerolas (66.3, 58.5) takes the breeze home; the Starbreeze Moonwell (63.4, 58.1) fills the Jade Phial; Tallonkai's Mystic (68.3, 52.2) and dresser (68.0, 59.7) close the Dreamcatcher. Loop back to Dolanaar with the report.
  turnin 475 -- A Troubling Breeze - the breeze to Gaerolas Talvethren
  accept 476 -- Gnarlpine Corruption - Gaerolas Talvethren; report back to Athridas in Dolanaar
  complete 929 @63.4,58.1 era -- the Jade Phial at the Starbreeze Village Moonwell
  complete 2438 @68.0,59.7 era -- the Dreamcatcher from Tallonkai's Dresser

