  complete 2459 @68.0,59.7 era -- Tallonkai's Jewel from the dresser (check it if the jewel isn't there)

step Dolanaar - Starbreeze returns

  tip Back through Dolanaar with Starbreeze's work: Gaerolas' word to Athridas, the Dreamcatcher to Tallonkai, the Jade Phial to Corithras - and Corithras starts the Tourmaline leg.

  turnin 476 -- Gnarlpine Corruption - Gaerolas's word to Athridas Bearmantle
  turnin 929 -- Crown of the Earth - the Jade Phial to Corithras Moonrage
  accept 933 -- Crown of the Earth - Corithras Moonrage; fill the Tourmaline Phial

step Lake Al'Ameth - Denalan

  tip Denalan (60.9, 68.5) keeps the lake garden. Timberlings west of the water seed it; the pools east fill the Tourmaline Phial; the Heart plants here if Blackmoss gave it up. Rellian's chain starts here too - his end of it lives in Darnassus.
  accept 918 -- Timberling Seeds - Denalan; eight Timberling Seeds
  complete 918 @54.3,66.2 era -- eight Timberling Seeds off the Timberlings, west of the lake
  turnin 918 -- Timberling Seeds - the seeds to Denalan
  accept 919 -- Timberling Sprouts - Denalan; twelve Timberling Sprouts
  complete 919 @50.9,70.8 era -- twelve Timberling Sprouts around the lake
  turnin 919 -- Timberling Sprouts - the sprouts to Denalan
  accept 922 -- Rellian Greenspyre - Denalan; Rellian waits in Darnassus, late
  turnin 927 -- The Moss-twined Heart - the Heart to Denalan
  accept 941 -- Planting the Heart - Denalan; plant it in the garden
  turnin 941 -- Planting the Heart - the Heart to Denalan's Planter (60.8, 68.6)
  turnin 997 -- Denalan's Earth - Syral's Earth to Denalan
  complete 933 @42.4,67.1 era -- the Tourmaline Phial at the Pools of Arlithrien Moonwell
  note Return to Denalan (2499) starts here but needs 2498 (Rellian, Darnassus) first - take it when offered and bring down Oakenscowl, a level-9 elite south-west of the lake.
  accept 2499 -- Return to Denalan - Denalan; Gargantuan Tumor from Oakenscowl

