step Dolanaar - lake returns

  tip Back through Dolanaar with the lake's work: the Tourmaline Phial to Corithras, who starts the Amethyst leg at the Oracle Glade.
  turnin 933 -- Crown of the Earth - the Tourmaline Phial to Corithras Moonrage
  accept 7383 -- Crown of the Earth - Corithras Moonrage; fill the Amethyst Phial at the Oracle Glade

step The Oracle Glade - Arynia

  tip West to the Oracle Glade: Arynia (38.3, 34.4) holds the glade against the harpies; Mist (31.5, 31.6) needs walking home; the Oracle Tree Bark (37.0, 34.0) and the Moonwell (38.4, 34.1) finish two chains. Shayla (42.2, 51.3) posts the Furbolg bounty on the way.
