step Ban'ethil Barrow Den - relics and rogues

  tip The barrow den south-west: Athridas's relic chests, Oben Rageclaw's druid business (Druids only), Tallonkai's ambushers, Zenn's cones, and Lynessa's escape. Shayla's bounty starts on the way in.
