step Darnassus - the city turn-ins

  tip One Darnassus trip closes the zone: Fandral takes the Crown and Teldrassil, Aquinne the Sisterhood, Rellian and Elanaria and Syurna and Mathrengyl their handoffs, Jocaste the Hunter's report. Astaia and Trianna take their Camping lessons here too (both optional).
