step Rut'theran Village - the crossing

  tip South to Rut'theran at the World Tree's roots: Nessa (56.3, 92.4) posts the Bounty, Vesprystus (58.4, 94.0) flies it out. Take 6341 if offered (Mydrannul, Darnassus, gates it) and cross to Auberdine.
  note The Bounty of Teldrassil (6341) starts with Nessa but needs 6344 (Mydrannul, Darnassus) first - take it when offered.
  accept 6341 -- The Bounty of Teldrassil - Nessa Shadowsong; Vesprystus flies the bounty out
  turnin 6341 -- The Bounty of Teldrassil - the bounty to Vesprystus
  accept 6342 -- Flight to Auberdine - Vesprystus; Laird waits in Auberdine, across the water

